{"seq":1,"slug":"animation-loop","title":"动画循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/animation-loop","wordCount":1055,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画循环\">动画循环</h1><p>Canvas 动画的本质朴素到近乎无聊：每隔一小段时间，把画布擦掉，按新状态重画一遍，快到肉眼看不出间断，就成了动画。难的从来不是这句话，而是「每隔一小段时间」该怎么实现才稳。用 <code>setInterval</code> 写动画曾经很流行，但它和显示器刷新不同步、后台标签页里照跑空转电、还无法适应不同刷新率的屏幕。现代答案是 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code>，再配上对「时间」的正确处理。这一篇就讲怎么把这个循环写对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>requestAnimationFrame(callback)</code>（简称 rAF）请求浏览器在下一次重绘前调用你的回调，调用频率与显示器刷新率对齐——60Hz 屏约每 16.7ms 一次，120Hz 屏约每 8.3ms 一次。回调会收到一个高精度时间戳，这是计算帧间隔的依据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;requestAnimationFrame(tick)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;浏览器等到下次重绘前&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;tick(timestamp) 被调用&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;dt = timestamp - lastTime&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;update(dt) 推进状态&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;clearRect 清屏&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;render() 重画当前帧&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;requestAnimationFrame(tick)&lt;br/&gt;预约下一帧&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"requestAnimationFrame(tick)\"] --&gt; B[\"浏览器等到下次重绘前\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"tick(timestamp) 被调用\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"dt = timestamp - lastTime\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"update(dt) 推进状态\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"clearRect 清屏\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"render() 重画当前帧\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"requestAnimationFrame(tick)&lt;br/&gt;预约下一帧\"]\n  H --&gt; B</pre><p>每帧三步：算出距上一帧过了多久（dt）、用 dt 推进逻辑状态、清屏并重画。最后再预约下一帧，形成自驱循环。清屏靠 <code>clearRect</code>，这正是<a href=\"../foundations/drawing-model\">即时绘制模型</a>里讲的「每帧擦掉重来」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"raf-对比传统定时器\">rAF 对比传统定时器</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th><code>setInterval</code>/<code>setTimeout</code></th>\n<th><code>requestAnimationFrame</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与刷新同步</td>\n<td>否，独立计时，易撕裂/掉帧</td>\n<td>是，对齐 vsync</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后台标签页</td>\n<td>仍按原频率跑，浪费 CPU/电</td>\n<td>自动暂停或降频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适应高刷屏</td>\n<td>否，固定间隔</td>\n<td>是，自动跟随 120/144Hz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳</td>\n<td>无，需自己 <code>performance.now()</code></td>\n<td>回调参数自带高精度时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"let last = performance.now();&#10;function tick(now) {&#10;  const dt = (now - last) / 1000; // 转秒&#10;  last = now;&#10;  update(dt);&#10;  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);&#10;  render();&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(tick);&#10;}&#10;requestAnimationFrame(tick);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 转秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clearRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, canvas.width, canvas.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tick);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tick);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"delta-time-让运动与帧率解耦\">delta time：让运动与帧率解耦</h2><p>新手最常见的错误是「每帧把位置加一个固定值」：<code>x += 2</code>。在 60Hz 屏上物体每秒走 120px，到了 120Hz 屏就变成 240px——同一份代码在不同设备上速度翻倍。正确做法是按时间积分：用速度（像素/秒）乘以本帧时长 dt。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{t+\\Delta t} = x_t + v \\cdot \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const speed = 120; // px/秒，与帧率无关&#10;function update(dt) {&#10;  x += speed * dt; // dt 大（掉帧）就走得多，dt 小就走得少&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> speed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// px/秒，与帧率无关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// dt 大（掉帧）就走得多，dt 小就走得少</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样无论 30 帧还是 144 帧，物体每秒都恰好移动 120px，运动与帧率彻底解耦。一个实战细节：标签页切到后台再回来，dt 可能变得很大（积压了几秒），导致物体「瞬移」；通常要给 dt 设上限（如 <code>Math.min(dt, 0.1)</code>）做钳制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"固定时间步长-稳定的物理与确定性\">固定时间步长：稳定的物理与确定性</h2><p>可变 dt 对简单移动够用，但碰撞检测、弹簧、堆叠等物理模拟对步长敏感——dt 抖动会让模拟发散或穿透。解法是固定时间步长（fixed timestep）：逻辑永远以固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（如 1/60 秒）推进，用一个累加器把真实流逝时间切成整数个固定步，渲染则用插值平滑显示。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const STEP = 1 / 60;&#10;let acc = 0;&#10;function tick(now) {&#10;  const frame = Math.min((now - last) / 1000, 0.25);&#10;  last = now;&#10;  acc += frame;&#10;  while (acc &gt;= STEP) {&#10;    physics(STEP); // 永远用相同步长推进物理&#10;    acc -= STEP;&#10;  }&#10;  render(acc / STEP); // 用剩余比例插值渲染&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(tick);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STEP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> frame</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frame;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STEP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    physics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STEP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 永远用相同步长推进物理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STEP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STEP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用剩余比例插值渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  requestAnimationFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tick);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>步长</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可变步长</td>\n<td>每帧 dt</td>\n<td>简单、永远跟得上</td>\n<td>物理不稳定、不可复现</td>\n<td>UI 动画、简单移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定步长</td>\n<td>恒定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>物理稳定、确定可复现</td>\n<td>实现复杂、需插值</td>\n<td>游戏物理、模拟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>固定步长还带来确定性：相同输入序列产生完全相同的结果，这对录像回放、网络同步至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暂停-节流与生命周期\">暂停、节流与生命周期</h2><p>rAF 返回一个 id，<code>cancelAnimationFrame(id)</code> 可停止循环——组件卸载时务必取消，否则循环会成为内存泄漏与幽灵更新的源头。配合 <code>document.visibilityState</code> 或 <code>IntersectionObserver</code>，可在画布不可见时停掉循环省电。每帧该做多少工作、如何避免在循环里做昂贵计算，是<a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a>的主战场；而循环里「先 update 再 render」的结构，正好对应<a href=\"scene-management\">场景管理</a>中「更新场景状态、再遍历场景重绘」的两阶段。命中检测产生的输入则在 update 阶段被消费，详见<a href=\"hit-detection\">命中检测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>动画 = 每帧清屏重画；用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 而非定时器，它对齐刷新率、后台自动降频、自带高精度时间戳。</li>\n<li>每帧三步：算 dt → <code>update(dt)</code> 推进状态 → 清屏并 <code>render</code>，最后预约下一帧。</li>\n<li>用 delta time 按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x += v\\cdot\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 积分，让运动速度与帧率解耦；对大 dt（后台回来）要钳制上限防瞬移。</li>\n<li>物理模拟用固定时间步长 + 累加器 + 渲染插值，换来稳定与确定性（可复现、可网络同步）。</li>\n<li>rAF 返回 id，卸载/不可见时 <code>cancelAnimationFrame</code> 取消循环，避免泄漏与空耗电。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画循环","id":"动画循环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"rAF 对比传统定时器","id":"raf-对比传统定时器"},{"level":2,"text":"delta time：让运动与帧率解耦","id":"delta-time-让运动与帧率解耦"},{"level":2,"text":"固定时间步长：稳定的物理与确定性","id":"固定时间步长-稳定的物理与确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"暂停、节流与生命周期","id":"暂停-节流与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"像素操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/pixel-manipulation"},"next":{"title":"命中检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/hit-detection"}}